            "review_text": "jiwooo86\nBusan, South Korea3 contributions\n0\nVery Classic Vietnamese pho\nSep 2025 • Friends\nI stopped by Pho Thin at Vinhomes Grand Park and it was a really satisfying meal. Very Classic Vietnamese pho. The beef was tender, the noodles had the perfect texture, and the fresh herbs brought everything together. The restaurant itself is clean and bright, with quick service even during busy hours. It’s a great spot for both residents and visitors in the area, and the location inside Vinhomes Grand Park makes it super convenient. Definitely a must-try if you’re craving authentic pho in Vinhomes Grand Park.\nRead more\nWritten September 18, 2025",
